DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The hhvvss driver provides support for a Storage Virtual Service Client
     (StorVSC), a virtual disk interface that relays device requests to the
     Virtual Service Provider (VSP) in the management operating system via the
     VMBus.

     StorVSC provides a unified interface to emulated IDE and SCSI devices.

